    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A WELL-PRESENTED FAMILY HOME, PERFECTLY POSITIONED FOR MODERN LIVING\r\n\r\nThis well-presented three-bedroom semidetached home is maintained in very good condition throughout and offers spacious and well-proportioned \r\naccommodation, making it an excellent family home.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generously sized family sitting room, a spacious kitchen and separate utility room, providing excellent practical living space.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a garage, ideal for additional storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main family bathroom. To the rear, the property enjoys a private and mature garden, featuring established shrubs and planting, creating a pleasant outdoor space.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within easy reach of Ennis town centre and a host of local amenities, this is a lovely home that offers both comfort and\r\nconvenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The following is the accommodation and approximate room dimensions (sq mtrs):-\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (Carpeted flooring) 2.32 x 1.27\r\n\r\nSitting Room (Carpeted flooring & open fireplace) 4.40 x 4.18\r\n\r\nKitchen (Lino flooring, built in kitchen units, induction hob & oven) 5.19 x 3.48\r\n\r\nUtility (Lino flooring, built in units & plumbed for washer/dryer) 2.64 x 2.52\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Timber flooring & built in wardrobe) 3.39 x 3.03\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Timber flooring & built in wardrobe) 3.86 x 2.71\r\n\r\nBedroom 3  (Carpeted flooring) 2.74 x 2.36\r\n\r\nBathroom (Fully tiled walls and flooring, bath & electric shower) 2.10 x 2.04\r\n\r\nThe total floor area is approximately 99.7 sq.mtrs (1,073.16 sq.ft)\r\n\r\nExterior\r\n\r\nGarage (Suitable for conversion)             4.87 x 2.59"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Excellent location on Clonroad within 0.5kms of Ennis Town Centre\r\n\r\n* Spacious accommodation throughout\r\n\r\n* Enclosed rear garden with mature shrubs\r\n\r\nConvenient access to the M18, with rail and bus services and Shannon Airport less than 30 minutes away"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C,BER: C \r\nBER No: 105115380\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 225 kWh/m2.yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "No. 7 Meadows Court enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of Ennis town centre and a wide range of everyday amenities. The property is situated close to the Old Ground Hotel and is adjacent to Dunnes Stores Shopping Centre and is within walking distance to the Clonroad Business Park.\r\n\r\nEnnis offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities, while the nearby M18 motorway\r\nprovides easy access to Limerick, Galway and Shannon. Shannon Airport is also within easy driving distance.\r\n\r\nThis superb location combines the convenience of being close to the heart of Ennis with the benefits of an established residential setting, making 7 Meadow Court an ideal choice for those looking to enjoy everything Ennis town has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by prior appointment only with sole selling agents"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Asking Price",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Offers in Excess of €280,000."
      }
